	Ø Changing Password
	- One should change intial password as soon as login
		○  command $ passwd userid
		- Old password : enter current password
		- New password : enter new password
		- Retype new password : re-enter new password.

Note: If one type passwd while logged in as root it will change root passwd.
		- Min 8 char and should pass dictionary check(not to be simple)

